{"item_id": "e4cc3d6c6c7bdbde", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "【视频播客】裁员潮下，互联网人该不该做独立开发？", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wHWo6ZEun", "project_url": null, "author": "熠辉IndieDev", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/39930228", "published_at": "2026-11-13T08:00:00+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-19T09:47:01+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "离开大厂，靠自己的产品能养活自己吗？这期结合我两年半独立开发的真实经历，聊聊 AI 时代互联网人的机会、工程师的优势，以及从找需求、做产品到获客赚钱的思路。也分享我为什么从内容变现转向做产品，以及「给 Agent 做产品」这个值得探索的方向。", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 23519, "danmaku": 7, "favorites": 1330}, "tags": ["VibeCoding", "上B站看播客", "视频播客", "AI"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1wHWo6ZEun", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wHWo6ZEun", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261119T094328"}
{"item_id": "830c1029230e4588", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "Vibe Coding 完不会获客？我用 AI 做了一个「营销数据库」！【B站AI创造公开赛】", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cVW86JE2e", "project_url": null, "author": "熠辉IndieDev", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/39930228", "published_at": "2026-11-10T09:00:00+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-19T09:47:01+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "产品做出来了，第一批用户去哪找？我用两个月做了 BizPeel，收录700多个公开营收的产品，拆解真实获客动作。本期演示在 Google Antigravity 接入 BizPeel MCP，由 Gemini 4 Argon 查找同类产品、整理增长实验；报告生成时用 Gemini Flash 清洗数据，再由 Gemini 4 Argon 撰写。\n\n注： 部分Google技术仅适用于出海场景。", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 76020, "danmaku": 3, "favorites": 2505}, "tags": ["Google 出海创新竞赛单元", "B站AI创造公开赛", "AI Agent", "Google Cloud", "Gemini", "Google", "独立开发"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1cVW86JE2e", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cVW86JE2e", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261119T094328"}
{"item_id": "a875a62c3c700e9d", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "决定做独立游戏前，先想清楚……", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nVsp6FEX2", "project_url": null, "author": "Gaby学姐说", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/3546782527130177", "published_at": "2026-11-15T20:03:48+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-19T09:47:01+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "两个人两个月卖了 2000 万份，谁看了不想说一句“我上我也行”？\n可就算打进 Steam 前 8%，三个人做两年，人均月入也就 6500 左右。\n决定做独立游戏之前，先想清楚四件事：这笔账怎么算、项目怎么立、凭什么被看见、扛不扛得住。", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 6943, "danmaku": 55, "favorites": 348}, "tags": ["游戏开发", "独立游戏发行", "万物研究所", "独立游戏开发者", "steam", "游戏杂谈", "独立游戏"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1nVsp6FEX2", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nVsp6FEX2", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261119T094328"}
{"item_id": "493c098238fd9250", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "独立开发者省钱之穷鬼套餐，从零开始完整实战，不花一分钱上线完整应用", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kY5XzrE6L", "project_url": null, "author": "技术爬爬虾", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/316183842", "published_at": "2025-04-22T16:52:36+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-19T09:47:01+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "爬爬虾逛论坛的时候，经常看到一个很有意思的选题，独立开发者省钱之穷鬼套餐。这些免费工具涵盖了前后端部署，代码托管，数据库，行为分析等等一系列功能。 尤其适合学生党、独立开发者，还有初创公司。 开发者们可以利用这些免费工具，0成本做出产品并且发布上线，等到开始盈利以后，再慢慢迭代，扩容。不过在网上的相关分享大多只是简单罗列工具清单，很少深入讲解实战应用。本期视频我准备用一个小项目，把这些免费工具全部串联起来，我们一起看看如何不花一分钱上线一个完整应用。", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 108343, "danmaku": 47, "favorites": 10666}, "tags": ["AI", "人工智能", "免费", "网站", "编程", "副业", "计算机", "软件", "科技", "开发者"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1kY5XzrE6L", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kY5XzrE6L", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261119T094328"}
